FIRE FIGHTING ROBOT
       The design that's being presented is concentrated on a firefighting robot. Robots are able of performing tasks in a more efficient, cost effective and accurate manner than humans.
Fire assumes a significant job in a mortal life still alongside that its dangerous too. A fire fighter work entails detecting and extinguishing fires. It is an amalgamation of fire detection
& alarming devices working in tandem with each other with an objective to sense the initial signs of fire and warn.

Problem Statement
             Fire and Gas leak incidents poses a significant threat to life and properties a certain condition poses difficult to reach by human and lack of quick reaction may causes serious damage. 
Therefore, fire- fighting robot are operated in places where firefighters are unfit to work. Besides that, firefighting robots can be used for guarding fire fighters from extreme peril in Petro- chemical,
chemical dangerous product, toxin or explored fire accidents.


Proposed Solutions
1. Our system will detect the Fire and Gas leak in real time.
2. Alams the User and Fire station.
3. Shuts off the fire using fire extinguisher or water.
4. It acts a quick reaction which will save many lives and properties
5. It is automated system so no risking of human life.
6. It can reach to narrow spaces.
7. It has more mobility.

Target Audience
1. The primary users of this solution are homeowners and apartments who are looking for primary fire safety system
2.Military and defense
3.Small fire departments.
4.Forest Areas

